{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44062","headline":"暗别离 · 刘瑶","name":"暗别离","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"槐花结子桐叶焦，单飞越鸟啼青霄。\n翠轩辗云轻遥遥，燕脂泪迸红线条。\n瑶草歇芳心耿耿，玉佩无声画屏冷。\n朱弦暗断不见人，风动花枝月中影。\n青鸾脉脉西飞去，海阔天高不知处。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘瑶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44062.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44062","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}